    "title": "When does Sabrina Carpenter perform at Coachella? How to watch.",
    "text": "Updated April 10, 2026, 1:16 p.m. ETSabrina Carpenter is ready to give it her all after months of prepping for Coachella.During a recent interview with Perfect Magazine, Carpenter, 26, spoke about her upcoming performance in conversation with fashion icon Marc Jacobs.\"It’s the most ambitious show I’ve ever done. It’s probably the most time I’ve ever had to actually just sit down and talk about a show as I’m building it,\" the \"Please Please Please\" singer shared.\"Most of the time, you’re really quickly thrust into physical rehearsals, but this time around we started this process around seven months ago. So it’s been a long journey. It will be very special,\" she continued.Here's what to know about how to watch Sabrina Carpenter's Coachella performance.When is Coachella 2026?The festival is two weekends: April 10- 12 and April 17-19.When is Sabrina Carpenter headlining at Coachella 2026?Festivalgoers can expect Carpenter to headline on both April 10 and April 17.When does Sabrina Carpenter perform at Coachella 2026 Weekend 1?Carpenter will hit the Coachella stage at about 9:05 p.m. PDT. Her set will be streaming on YouTube during that time slot.Fans can watch Coachella performances on the video platform on April 10 starting at 4 p.m. PT/ 7 p.m. ET. Through the YouTube app on your TV, you can stream multiple stages simultaneously from your couch.Coachella 2026 Weekend 1 set timesA complete list of day-by-day set times can be found on Coachella's website or in an Instagram post below:Taylor Ardrey is a news reporter for USA TODAY. You can reach her at tardrey@usatodayco.com.",
